    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witchy Wonderland</strong> is a thrilling horror-park simulator where you're not just building attractions\u2014you\u2019re crafting nightmares. Step into the pointy boots of an evil witch and design the most terrifying amusement park the world has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Lure in unsuspecting visitors, then scare them out of their wits with haunted houses, cursed cornfields, monster-infested graveyards, and much more. Collect their money, expand your eerie empire, and keep raising the fear factor. The more terrifying your park, the more guests will come\u2026 until they realize this isn\u2019t just fun and games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike ordinary amusement parks, in <i>Witchy Wonderland</i>, the horrors are real. Ghouls, ghosts, and twisted creatures roam the grounds\u2014and it\u2019s your job to keep them entertained (and alive). Upgrade your witchy powers, hire cursed performers, and unleash chaos on a growing crowd of thrill-seekers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become the ultimate master of fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your witch and unlock new spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and expand horror-themed attractions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scare visitors with real monsters and haunted events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless progression and park upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Witchy Wonderland</i>\u2014where the screams are real and the fun is deadly.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witchy Wonderland</strong> is a thrilling horror-park simulator where you're not just building attractions\u2014you\u2019re crafting nightmares. Step into the pointy boots of an evil witch and design the most terrifying amusement park the world has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Lure in unsuspecting visitors, then scare them out of their wits with haunted houses, cursed cornfields, monster-infested graveyards, and much more. Collect their money, expand your eerie empire, and keep raising the fear factor. The more terrifying your park, the more guests will come\u2026 until they realize this isn\u2019t just fun and games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike ordinary amusement parks, in <i>Witchy Wonderland</i>, the horrors are real. Ghouls, ghosts, and twisted creatures roam the grounds\u2014and it\u2019s your job to keep them entertained (and alive). Upgrade your witchy powers, hire cursed performers, and unleash chaos on a growing crowd of thrill-seekers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become the ultimate master of fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your witch and unlock new spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and expand horror-themed attractions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scare visitors with real monsters and haunted events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless progression and park upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Witchy Wonderland</i>\u2014where the screams are real and the fun is deadly.</p>",
